        "Content": "<ul><li> Three-bedroom, two-bathroom detached property</li><li> Excellent A3-rated BER</li><li> Full SEAI deep retrofit (2018): heat pump (Air-to-Water), solar PV, mechanical ventilation, upgraded insulation, and rewiring.</li><li> Featured on RTÉ's Eco Eye (2018)</li><li> South-facing rear garden</li><li> Electric car charging port</li><li> Double-glazed windows throughout</li><li> CAT5 internet points in each room</li><li> Excellent location in quiet cul-de-sac</li><li> Private, off-street, spacious driveway</li><li> Well connected to public transport: H1 and No.15 bus routes; Howth Junction & Donaghmede DART</li><li> Close to M50, M1, and Dublin Airport</ul>"
